  "subject": "来た~♡射手座の満月に♪あなたの美と幸せMAXなご縁繋ぎを最強にしちゃう秘訣♪",
  "context": "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0,minimum-scale=1.0,maximum-scale=1.0,user-scalable=no\"><title></title><style type=\"text/css\">span{word-wrap: break-word;}</style><body style=\"font-family:'Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN', 'ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3', sans-serif\" align=\"left\"><body><div style=\"min-height: 11px\"><img src=\"https://resast.jp//pictures/randing_pages/10351_1%E3%83%AA%E3%82%B6%E3%82%B9%E3%83%88%E3%83%90%E3%83%8A%E3%83%BC.jpg\" alt=\"image\" width=\"100%\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">((customer_name))\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 11px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">英国IFA認定国際アロマセラピストの岩本が、\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">唯一無二の大切なあなたの\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">心身魂のトータルケアを\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">お手伝いいたします。\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">アロマリア自然療法の学校 \n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">校長岩本純子です♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">2019年12月12日(*^▽^*)♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">わーい♡わーい♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">来た‼︎\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">来てます‼︎\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">いや〜ん‼︎\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">そうそう☆( ^ω^ )☆\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">来てるのよぉ〜♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">何がって⁉︎\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">それは今年一番の\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">美人度をアゲアゲにしちゃう♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">双子座の満月｡ﾟ(ﾟ´ω`ﾟ)ﾟ｡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 11px\"><img src=\"https://image.reservestock.jp/pictures/9582_NmUyM2VkNzNiNmI2Z.jpg\" alt=\"image\" width=\"100%\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">ここ一番‼︎\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">美人度を\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">アゲアゲにしたい方と！？\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">幸せになっちゃう\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">素晴らしいご縁を\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">つなげたい<span style=\"color: #996633; font-size: 14px\">((friendly_name))♡\n</span></div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\"><span style=\"color: #996633; font-size: 14px\">\n</span></div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 18px\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold\">\n</span></div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 18px\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold\">ここ一番の願いを込めて☆\n</span></div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 18px\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold\">手放すべきは手放し〜♪\n</span></div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 18px\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold\">\n</span></div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 18px\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold\">迎えるべきは\n</span></div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 18px\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold\">めっちゃウェルカムで\n</span></div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 18px\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold\">お迎えしてくださいませ♡♡♡\n</span></div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\"><span style=\"color: #996633; font-size: 14px\">\n</span></div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">私は絶賛MAXで♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">幸せつなぎに日々\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">勤しんでおりましたら♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">なんとなんと♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">めっちゃ素晴らしいご縁と\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">幸せをおつなぎいただけました♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">これは♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">日本中、\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">いえいえ‼︎\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">世界中どこでも\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">今の世の中での\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">幸せのご縁が\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">つながるという♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">心の底から♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">ありがたい〜♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">ありがたすぎちゃう♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">暗黙のご縁ループが\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">具現化して♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">現実化することが\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">わかっちゃいました♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">きゃん♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">素敵〜♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">　\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">今から♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">その秘訣♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">と\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">その方法を\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">とっても大切な((friendly_name))に\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">ご紹介させて\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">いただきたいと思います(๑˃̵ᴗ˂̵)♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">心の用意はいいですか〜♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">ドラムロール♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">ドドドド〜♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">、、、、、、、\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">、、、、、、、\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">、、、、、、、\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">るんるん\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">ルンルン♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">♡♡♡♡♡♡♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">じゃーん♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">♪発表♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">それは(๑˃̵ᴗ˂̵)♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">大切で♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">つながりたい方のことを\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">一生懸命に♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">↓↓↓↓↓\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">『その方が幸せになるように』と\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">ただ純粋に♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">『その方がどうしたら幸せになれるのか』を\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">一生懸命♡ \n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">ただひたすらに♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">祈ることなんです♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">とってもシンプルな\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">ことなんですよね( ^ω^ )♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">本日双子座の満月\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">あなたは何を願いますか！？\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 11px\"><img src=\"https://image.reservestock.jp/pictures/9582_MDJmOGY2ODlhMzVmN.jpg\" alt=\"image\" width=\"100%\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">　\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">本日の満月は、仕事や貯蓄、\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">経済面に直結するエネルギーの\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">惑星配置になり、\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">自分のコミュニケーションパターンや、\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">学びに関することについて手放し、\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">改善を誓ってみるといいそうですね♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">新たに興味を持てそうなことや、\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">心がワクワクする情報などを\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">探して取り入れるのにも最適ですね♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">　\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">双子座は、心身ともに\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">若々しさをキープできる\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">パワーも持っている星座ですので\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">ユニシティの美肌になる秘訣の\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">ネージーンもお使いいただければ\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">“遺伝子発現”パワーチャージで\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">“乙女の美人力をパワフルに\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">発動”してくれますね♪\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">そちらもどうぞ\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">お楽しみくださいませ♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">新しく来る新年と\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">愛でつながる新時代♡\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">ゴールデンゲートが\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 14px\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"min-height